    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math> as change in internal energy depends on initial and final state and not the path.<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> By comparing area under the curve,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><msub><mrow/><mi>A</mi></msub></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><msub><mrow/><mi>B</mi></msub></msub></math><br />From <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math><br />We can say, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></msub></math>"
